    "directives": "* Buck converter with ideal voltage-controlled switch (SW model)\n* NOTE: The ideal SW model has discontinuous resistance at Vt=2.5V which causes\n* convergence failures in transient simulation when combined with the freewheeling\n* diode's exponential I-V curve. This is a known SPICE limitation.\n* For a working simulation of the switch model, see pwm_rl_load.csim\n.model MYSW SW(Ron=0.1 Roff=1e6 Vt=2.5 Vh=0.5)\n.model 1N5819 D(IS=1e-9 N=1 RS=0.05 CJO=1e-10 M=0.5)",
